<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Arizona State University participates in the <a href="https://students.asu.edu/admission/wue">Western Undergraduate Exchange (WUE)</a>; a program coordinated by the Western Interstate Commission for Higher Education (WICHE). Students in a WUE program only pay 150 percent of Arizona base resident tuition plus all applicable fees for fall and spring terms. In order to qualify for this reduced tuition, students must meet the following criteria:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Students must be a permanent resident of Alaska, California, Colorado, Hawaii, Idaho, Montana, Nevada, New Mexico, North Dakota, Oregon, South Dakota, Utah, Washington, Wyoming or residents of the Commonwealth of the Northern Mariana Islands.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Students must apply to one of the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/programs/Keyword/wue/undergrad/false">ASU WUE-eligible majors or programs</a>.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Transfer students must have an overall GPA of 2.50 or higher on a 4.00 scale in all transferable course work.</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Community college transfer students must have an associate degree or 60 transferable credit hours (BAS degree programs are only open to students who have an AAS or equivalent degree).&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Students who enroll in one of these majors and meet the eligibility requirements will automatically receive the discounted tuition. No separate application is required.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}<br><br></font><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>